    <string name="guide_title">How to Connect to PC</string>
    <string name="guide_step_1_title">1. Open Antigravity 2.0 on PC</string>
    <string name="guide_step_1_desc">Launch Antigravity 2.0 on your computer.</string>
    <string name="guide_step_2_title">2. Settings ⚙️ ➔ Application ➔ Remote Control</string>
    <string name="guide_step_2_desc">Go to Settings (⚙️) ➔ Application tab ➔ Switch on \'Enable Remote Control\' to show the QR Code.</string>
    <string name="guide_step_3_title">3. Scan QR or Paste Link</string>
    <string name="guide_step_3_desc">Tap \'Scan QR Code on Screen\' to scan the code, or click \'copy link\' on your PC and tap \'Paste Link &amp; Connect\' below.</string>
